# Language

Write all program source in English: identifiers, comments, UI copy, error messages, and logs.

```jsx
// Bad
<p>Base del proyecto lista.</p>

// Good
<p>Project base is ready.</p>
```

Reply to the user in Spanish. Keep the README in Spanish; it is for the user, not program source.
